Two fixes are needed in the tests: ImageIO returns property dictionaries as Objective-C dictionaries, so direct Swift `[CFString: Any]` lookup is too brittle; and the malformed EXIF fixture was inserted before the JPEG header segment, which made the whole image unreadable. I’m fixing both.
